 {"topic":"release_and_future_binding","finding":"Exactly four unresolved literal values and separate release/self/hash/branch/pin admission are retained. The draft rejects unresolved bindings and disabled assertions before repository admission."},
 {"topic":"original_negative_and_v2","finding":"The preserved 1DD predecessor checks only original committed prefix spellings. The selected v2 adds a distinct combined planned map before any copy; original existing-only absence checks remain exact."},
