 {"topic":"attribute_admission","finding":"All five attributes are captured for the full target list. Filter, working-tree-encoding and ident must be unset or unspecified before any path-aware hash. Configuration origins/scope and system/global/info/root/ancestor attribute bytes or absence are retained."},
 {"topic":"object_identity","finding":"Repository object format selects the independent raw blob digest. Binary donor bytes must agree with Git no-filter and path-aware IDs without object writes. The project BASIS contract remains forty-hex SHA-1; no broader commit-format support is claimed."},
